  "prompt": {
    "user_question": "Investigate single-nucleus chromatin accessibility across 6 post-mortem human hippocampal donors comparing aged_80_100 (hc11, hc12, hc19) versus young_20_39 (hc29, hc77, hc76) individuals (GEO GSE278576, Homo sapiens hg38). Perform scATAC QC, TF-IDF and LSI dimensionality reduction (discarding depth-correlated component 1), donor-aware chromatin clustering, donor-level pseudobulk differential accessibility comparing aged_80_100 versus young_20_39, JASPAR TF motif enrichment, and cis gene annotation.",
